Wrong (A): $500 represents gross revenue, which would apply only if the agency were a principal that controlled the rooms before transfer to the customer.
Wrong (C): $450 incorrectly deducts the commission from the booking price; the agency''s revenue is the commission earned, not the amount remitted to the hotel.
